    {
      "key": "seed_genes",
      "value_json": "[{\"type\":\"structure\",\"text\":\"Maintain an archive indexed by contact graph and aspect-ratio bin. Reserve parent slots for distinct feasible graphs even when their scores are below the incumbent. Cross parents by transplanting a spatial cluster of two to four circles, repair the interface, and jointly refine; reject duplicate graphs rather than merely duplicate coordinates.\"},{\"type\":\"formulation\",\"text\":\"Trace packing branches with rectangle width fixed and height equal to two minus width. Sweep width in both directions from several structurally distinct starts, warm-start each branch, and retain hysteresis or contact-graph changes. Release width only after the sweep, then refine and verify each distinct branch.\"},{\"type\":\"structure\",\"text\":\"Test coordinated contact surgery on connected clusters of three to six active contacts, including mirrored clusters when symmetry is imposed. Drive the selected gaps through a finite continuation excursion before restoring feasibility. Archive distinct repaired contact graphs despite temporary score loss, and periodically release symmetry for unrestricted refinement.\"}]"
    }
  ]
